/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 10789 0 R
/T (A recursive function in which the recursive call is the last statement executed by the function. So basically nothing is left to execute after the recursion call.)
/E (A recursive function in which the recursive call is the last statement executed by the function. So basically nothing is left to execute after the recursion call.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
2088 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 10790 0 R
